<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>People Pulse | Smarter HR visibility</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css" />
</head>
<body class="landing-body">
  <header class="landing-header">
    <div class="landing-container landing-header-inner">
      <a href="/" class="landing-brand">
        <div class="landing-brand-mark">
          <span>PEOPLE</span>
          <span>PULSE</span>
        </div>
      </a>

      <nav class="landing-nav">
        <a href="#benefits">Benefits</a>
        <a href="#product">Product</a>
        <a href="#screens">Screens</a>
        <a href="/login" class="landing-login-btn">HR Login</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="landing-hero">
      <div class="landing-container landing-hero-grid">
        <div class="landing-hero-copy">
          <span class="landing-kicker">Workforce visibility for modern HR teams</span>
          <h1>Spot overload earlier and manage workforce risk with confidence.</h1>
          <p class="landing-subheadline">
            People Pulse brings hiring, staffing, workload, organisational visibility,
            and prediction signals into one simple HR operations platform.
          </p>

          <div class="landing-hero-actions">
            <a href="/login" class="landing-primary-btn">Log in to the platform</a>
            <a href="#product" class="landing-secondary-btn">See how it works</a>
          </div>

          <div class="landing-proof-row">
            <div class="landing-proof-item">
              <strong>Dashboard</strong>
              <span>Track hiring and HR activity</span>
            </div>
            <div class="landing-proof-item">
              <strong>Workload</strong>
              <span>See team pressure and capacity</span>
            </div>
            <div class="landing-proof-item">
              <strong>Predictions</strong>
              <span>Highlight emerging risk patterns</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="landing-hero-panel">
          <div class="hero-preview-card">
            <div class="hero-preview-top">
              <span class="hero-dot"></span>
              <span class="hero-dot"></span>
              <span class="hero-dot"></span>
            </div>

            <div class="hero-preview-metrics">
              <div class="hero-metric-box">
                <span>High-risk employees</span>
                <strong>12</strong>
              </div>
              <div class="hero-metric-box">
                <span>Teams under pressure</span>
                <strong>4</strong>
              </div>
              <div class="hero-metric-box">
                <span>Overdue projects</span>
                <strong>7</strong>
              </div>
              <div class="hero-metric-box">
                <span>Hiring pipeline</span>
                <strong>24</strong>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="hero-preview-bars">
              <div class="hero-bar-row">
                <span>Operations</span>
                <div class="hero-bar-track"><div class="hero-bar-fill bar-90"></div></div>
              </div>
              <div class="hero-bar-row">
                <span>HR</span>
                <div class="hero-bar-track"><div class="hero-bar-fill bar-72"></div></div>
              </div>
              <div class="hero-bar-row">
                <span>Finance</span>
                <div class="hero-bar-track"><div class="hero-bar-fill bar-58"></div></div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="benefits" class="landing-section">
      <div class="landing-container">
        <div class="landing-section-head">
          <span class="landing-section-kicker">Why People Pulse</span>
          <h2>Built for HR teams that need more than static records.</h2>
          <p>
            Move from reactive admin work to clearer operational decision-making with
            one shared view of hiring, people data, team pressure, and early warning signals.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="benefit-grid">
          <article class="benefit-card">
            <h3>See workforce pressure earlier</h3>
            <p>
              Combine workload, team structure, staffing, and project pressure into one
              view so rising risk is easier to spot before burnout becomes a people issue.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="benefit-card">
            <h3>Connect hiring with capacity</h3>
            <p>
              Understand where hiring demand, employee load, and department pressure
              intersect so teams can prioritise better and plan with more confidence.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="benefit-card">
            <h3>Turn HR data into action</h3>
            <p>
              Go beyond record-keeping with dashboards, insights, workload views,
              and prediction-focused pages that support real operational decisions.
            </p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="product" class="landing-section landing-section-alt">
      <div class="landing-container">
        <div class="landing-section-head">
          <span class="landing-section-kicker">Product overview</span>
          <h2>One platform across core HR workflows and forward-looking insights.</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-grid">
          <article class="feature-card">
            <h3>Dashboard</h3>
            <p>Monitor hiring activity, recruitment progress, and headline HR metrics.</p>
          </article>

          <article class="feature-card">
            <h3>Workload</h3>
            <p>Review capacity, pressure indicators, and team distribution of work.</p>
          </article>

          <article class="feature-card">
            <h3>Insights</h3>
            <p>Surface meaningful patterns across employees, departments, and projects.</p>
          </article>

          <article class="feature-card">
            <h3>Predictions</h3>
            <p>Bring together calendar signals, risk cards, team heatmaps, and manager scorecards.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="screens" class="landing-section">
      <div class="landing-container">
        <div class="landing-section-head">
          <span class="landing-section-kicker">Screens</span>
          <h2>Show the platform, not just the idea.</h2>
          <p>
            Add real screenshots from your live product to make the landing page much stronger for demos and pitching.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="screens-grid">
          <article class="screen-card">
            <div class="screen-image-wrap">
              <img
                src="/images/dashboard-preview.png"
                alt="Dashboard preview"
                class="screen-image"
                onerror="this.style.display='none'; this.nextElementSibling.style.display='flex';"
              />
              <div class="screen-placeholder">Add dashboard screenshot</div>
            </div>
            <div class="screen-copy">
              <h3>Dashboard</h3>
              <p>Overview of hiring activity, status tracking, and recent HR actions.</p>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="screen-card">
            <div class="screen-image-wrap">
              <img
                src="/images/workload-preview.png"
                alt="Workload preview"
                class="screen-image"
                onerror="this.style.display='none'; this.nextElementSibling.style.display='flex';"
              />
              <div class="screen-placeholder">Add workload screenshot</div>
            </div>
            <div class="screen-copy">
              <h3>Workload</h3>
              <p>Capacity visibility, employee pressure, and team-level workload balance.</p>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="screen-card">
            <div class="screen-image-wrap">
              <img
                src="/images/insights-preview.png"
                alt="Insights preview"
                class="screen-image"
                onerror="this.style.display='none'; this.nextElementSibling.style.display='flex';"
              />
              <div class="screen-placeholder">Add insights screenshot</div>
            </div>
            <div class="screen-copy">
              <h3>Insights</h3>
              <p>Useful signals and summaries that help HR teams prioritise action.</p>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="screen-card">
            <div class="screen-image-wrap">
              <img
                src="/images/predictions-preview.png"
                alt="Predictions preview"
                class="screen-image"
                onerror="this.style.display='none'; this.nextElementSibling.style.display='flex';"
              />
              <div class="screen-placeholder">Add predictions screenshot</div>
            </div>
            <div class="screen-copy">
              <h3>Predictions</h3>
              <p>Calendar view, risk cards, team heatmap, capacity comparison, and manager scorecards.</p>
            </div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="landing-cta">
      <div class="landing-container landing-cta-box">
        <div>
          <span class="landing-section-kicker">Ready to explore?</span>
          <h2>Open the platform and continue building the product story through the app itself.</h2>
        </div>
        <a href="/login" class="landing-primary-btn">Go to login</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</body>
</html>